  "Residents can speak for up to five minutes in the public comment period near the start of each business, workshop and special meeting, on an agenda item or anything else within the committee's responsibility, after writing their name and address on the sign-up sheet. When a meeting is held remotely, send a written statement of no more than one page to the Superintendent's Office by 3:00 PM that day.": {
